{"files": [{"id": 37855570, "name": "pbio.3001805.s006.tif", "size": 14174680, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/37855570", "supplied_md5": "02c524e548010ee2836644f668fa082d", "computed_md5": "02c524e548010ee2836644f668fa082d", "mimetype": "image/tiff"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 13955914, "full_name": "Jaewon Song", "first_name": "Jaewon", "last_name": "Song", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10319219, "full_name": "Ryan D. Chow", "first_name": "Ryan D.", "last_name": "Chow", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 14009135, "full_name": "Mario A. Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "first_name": "Mario A.", "last_name": "Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8200, "full_name": "Li Zhang", "first_name": "Li", "last_name": "Zhang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Li_Zhang", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955920, "full_name": "Skylar A. Loeb", "first_name": "Skylar A.", "last_name": "Loeb", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955923, "full_name": "Eui-Young So", "first_name": "Eui-Young", "last_name": "So", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955926, "full_name": "Olin D. Liang", "first_name": "Olin D.", "last_name": "Liang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 129621, "full_name": "Ping Ren", "first_name": "Ping", "last_name": "Ren", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 127044, "full_name": "Sidi Chen", "first_name": "Sidi", "last_name": "Chen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8677404, "full_name": "Craig B. Wilen", "first_name": "Craig B.", "last_name": "Wilen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 179163, "full_name": "Sanghyun Lee", "first_name": "Sanghyun", "last_name": "Lee", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/LRRC15_is_not_an_entry_receptor_for_SARS-CoV-2_/21330262", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>(<b>A</b>, <b>B</b>) A375 cells (<b>A</b>) or HeLa cells (<b>B</b>) transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs were infected with VSV pseudoviruses VSV\u0394G-S-SARS2 or VSV\u0394G-G. GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 3). (<b>C</b>) HeLa cells stably expressing ACE2 (HeLa-ACE2) were assessed for cell surface expression of ACE2 by flow cytometry. (<b>D</b>) HeLa or HeLa-ACE2 cells were infected with VSV pseudovirus harboring SARS-CoV-2 spike and GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 4). (E) HeLa-ACE2 cells transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs were assessed for surface expression of LRRC15 by flow cytometry. (<b>F</b>) HeLa-ACE2 cells expressing LRRC15 or empty vector were assessed for surface expression of LRRC15 by flow cytometry. (<b>G</b>) Huh7.5 cells transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs were assessed for surface expression of LRRC15 by flow cytometry. (<b>H</b>, <b>I</b>) HeLa-ACE2 cells transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs (<b>H</b>) or 293T-ACE2/TMPRSS2 cells expressing LRRC15 or empty vector (<b>I</b>) were pretreated with DMSO or camostat for 1 h and infected with VSV\u0394G-S-SARS2. GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 3). Data represent means \u00b1 SD (<b>A</b>, <b>B</b>, <b>D</b>, <b>H</b>, <b>I</b>). Data were analyzed unpaired two-tailed <i>t</i> test (<b>D</b>, <b>H</b>, <b>I</b>); ns, not significant; *<i>p</i> < 0.05; **<i>p</i> < 0.01. For underlying data, see <b><a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805#pbio.3001805.s003\" target=\"_blank\">S3 Data</a></b>. ACE2, angiotensin-converting enzyme 2; GFP, green fluorescent protein; hpi, hours postinfection; LRRC15, leucin-rich repeat-containing 15; SARS-CoV-2, Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus 2; sgRNA, single guide RNA; TMPRSS2, transmembrane protease serine 2; VSV, vesicular stomatitis virus.</p> <p>(TIF)</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 14174680, "created_date": "2022-10-13T18:04:40Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-13T06:56:36Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", "lrrc15 </", "trans </", "surface </", "spike protein", "protective role", "primarily detected", "physiological context", "particularly enriched", "moderate affinity", "largely unknown", "extensively studied", "binding domain", ">, suggesting", "19 patients"], "keywords": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", "lrrc15 </", "trans </", "surface </", "spike protein", "protective role", "primarily detected", "physiological context", "particularly enriched", "moderate affinity", "largely unknown", "extensively studied", "binding domain", ">, suggesting", "19 patients"], "categories": [{"id": 4, "title": "Biochemistry", "parent_id": 38, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 12, "title": "Cell Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 14, "title": "Molecular Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 19, "title": "Pharmacology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 46, "title": "Immunology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 734, "title": "Biological Sciences not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 64, "title": "Cancer", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 132, "title": "Infectious Diseases", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 134, "title": "Virology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}], "references": ["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805"], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Song, Jaewon; Chow, Ryan D.; Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez, Mario A.; Zhang, Li; Loeb, Skylar A.; So, Eui-Young; et al. (2022). LRRC15 is not an entry receptor for SARS-CoV-2.. PLOS Biology. Figure. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805.s006", "related_materials": [{"id": 76501944, "identifier": "10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805", "title": "LRRC15 inhibits SARS-CoV-2 cellular entry in trans", "relation": "IsSupplementTo", "identifier_type": "DOI", "is_linkout": true, "link": "https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805"}], "is_embargoed": false, "embargo_date": null, "embargo_type": null, "embargo_title": "", "embargo_reason": "", "embargo_options": [], "id": 21330262, "title": "LRRC15 is not an entry receptor for SARS-CoV-2.", "doi": "10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805.s006", "handle": "", "url": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/21330262", "published_date": "2022-10-13T18:04:40Z", "thumb": "https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/ppreviews-plos-725668748/37855570/thumb.png", "defined_type": 1, "defined_type_name": "figure", "group_id": 116, "url_private_api": "https:/